# Facturador — Core Principles

Personal academy manager + **private bookkeeping** (Tauri + React + TypeScript). See `docs/product/PLAN.md` and `docs/product/ANALISIS.md`.

## Top 10 rules

1. **Bookkeeping only** — Internal payment records/receipts. No VeriFactu, AEAT, SII, or legal invoicing.
2. **English code, bilingual UI** — Identifiers in English; UI via i18next; **`es` default**, `en` in Settings.
3. **Semantic names** — `Student`, `PaymentRecord`, `Enrollment`; never `COD_CLI`, `db_clientes`, `facturas`.
4. **Modular features** — `src/features/<name>/` registers in nav registry; no cross-feature imports.
5. **Atomic components** — Small primitives in `core/components/`; no god components.
6. **Pure domain** — Business rules in `src/domain/` (no React); Vitest for billing/ID logic.
7. **Local-first + backup** — SQLite via Tauri; one-click `.facturador-backup.zip`. Encryption/PIN **opt-in only**.
8. **Fail safe on money** — Duplicate billing warnings; atomic record numbers; voided ≠ deleted; settings flow to PDFs.
9. **Single services** — `core/pdf/`, `core/backup/`, `core/ids/` only; no duplicates in features.
10. **Non-breaking additions** — New features via registry + domain types; don't patch unrelated modules.
11. **Global font token** — `--font-family-sans` in `index.css`; never hardcode `font-family` in components.
12. **Responsive UI** — Mobile-first layouts; works on any screen size (see `ui-ux-theming.mdc`).

## Before large changes

Read `docs/product/PLAN.md` phase. New screen → feature module + registry + i18n (`es` + `en`). Billing bugs → domain test first.

## Never

- VeriFactu/AEAT/legal invoice compliance
- `localStorage` for domain data (target: SQLite)
- Spanish or abbreviated identifiers in code
- Mandatory auth/encryption
- `alert()` / `confirm()` for UX
- Emojis in UI or i18n — use `lucide-react` icons instead (see `ui-ux-theming.mdc`)
